msgstr "point display"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:9
msgid "点显示节点用于根据提供的检测结果，在图像的特定坐标位置绘制实心点标记。"
msgstr ""
"The Point Display node is used to draw solid point markers at specific "
"coordinate locations in the image based on the provided detection results."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:11
msgid "该节点特别适合标中心点或小型目标位置，支持多种颜色方案和自定义点大小配置。相比圆形标记，实心点更加简洁明了。"
msgstr ""
"This node is ideal for marking center points or small target locations, and "
"supports multiple color schemes and custom point size "
"configurations.Compared to round marks, solid dots are more concise and "
"clear."

