#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:62
msgid "``10``"
msgstr "``10``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:63
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:95
msgid "**自定义颜色**"
msgstr "**Custom Color**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:64
msgid "自定义颜色列表，使用HEX格式定义点颜色"
msgstr "Custom color list, use HEX format to define point colors"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:65
msgid "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"
msgstr "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:66
msgid "**颜色坐标轴**"
msgstr "**Color Axis**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:67
msgid "颜色分配的依据，通常基于类别（CLASS）来着色"
msgstr ""
"The basis for color assignment, usually coloring based on category (CLASS)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:68
msgid "``CLASS``"
msgstr "``CLASS``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:69
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:113
msgid "**坐标位置**"
msgstr "**Coordinate location**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:70
msgid "点的锚点位置"
msgstr "anchor position of point"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:71
msgid "``CENTER``"
msgstr "``CENTER``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:72
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:128
msgid "**点大小**"
msgstr "**Point size**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:73
msgid "点的半径大小（像素）"
msgstr "Point radius size (pixels)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:74
msgid "``4``"
msgstr "``4``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:75
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:138
msgid "**轮廓粗细**"
msgstr "**Contour Thickness**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:76
msgid "点的轮廓粗细（以像素为单位）"
msgstr "The outline thickness of the point in pixels"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:77
msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:80
msgid "参数详细说明"
msgstr "Detailed description of parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:84
msgid "**True**：创建图像副本，原始图像保持不变，可用于后续其他可视化操作"
msgstr ""
"**True**: Create a copy of the image, the original image remains unchanged "
"and can be used for other subsequent visualization operations"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:85
msgid "**False**：直接在原图上绘制，节省内存但会修改原图"
msgstr ""
"**False**: Draw directly on the original image, saving memory but modifying "
"the original image."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:89
msgid "支持多种颜色调色板方案："
msgstr "Supports multiple color palette schemes:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:91
msgid "``DEFAULT``：系统默认配色方案"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``: system default color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:92
msgid "``MATPLOTLIB``：使用Matplotlib的颜色方案"
msgstr "``MATPLOTLIB``: Use Matplotlib's color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:93
msgid "``CUSTOM``：使用自定义颜色列表（需配置自定义颜色参数）"
msgstr ""
"``CUSTOM``: Use a custom color list (custom color parameters need to be "
"configured)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:97
msgid "当调色板选择 ``CUSTOM`` 时，使用HEX格式定义颜色列表："
msgstr ""
"When ``CUSTOM`` is selected for the palette, use HEX format to define the "
"color list:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:103
msgid "分别对应红色、绿色、蓝色、黄色、紫色，颜色会按顺序分配给不同的类别。"
msgstr ""
"Corresponding to red, green, blue, yellow, and purple, the colors will be "
"assigned to different categories in order."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:105
msgid "**颜色坐标轴(在CUSTOM模式下会被忽略)**"
msgstr "**Color axis (ignored in CUSTOM mode)**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:107
msgid "决定如何为点标记分配颜色："
msgstr "Decide how to assign colors to point markers:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:109
msgid "``CLASS``：根据物体类别着色，同类物体使用相同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``CLASS``: Color according to object category, similar objects use the same "
"color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:110
msgid "``INDEX``：为每个物体分配不同颜色"
msgstr "``INDEX``: assign a different color to each object"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:111
msgid "``TRACK``：根据Tracker ID着色，每个Tracker ID使用不同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``TRACK``: Colored according to Tracker ID, use different colors for each "
"Tracker ID"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:115
msgid "点标记的锚点位置，可选值包括："
msgstr ""
"The anchor point position of the point marker. Optional values ​​include:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:117
msgid "``CENTER``：点标记以坐标点为中心"
msgstr "``CENTER``: The point marker is centered on the coordinate point"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:118
msgid "``CENTER_LEFT``：点标记以坐标点为左侧中心"
msgstr ""
"``CENTER_LEFT``: The point mark uses the coordinate point as the left center"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:119
msgid "``CENTER_RIGHT``：点标记以坐标点为右侧中心"
msgstr ""
"``CENTER_RIGHT``: The point mark uses the coordinate point as the right "
"center"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:120
msgid "``TOP_CENTER``：点标记以坐标点为上侧中心"
msgstr ""
"``TOP_CENTER``: The point mark takes the coordinate point as the upper "
"center"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:121
msgid "``TOP_LEFT``：点标记以坐标点为左上角"
msgstr ""
"``TOP_LEFT``: The point mark uses the coordinate point as the upper left "
"corner"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:122
msgid "``TOP_RIGHT``：点标记以坐标点为右上角"
msgstr ""
"``TOP_RIGHT``: The point mark uses the coordinate point as the upper right "
"corner"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:123
msgid "``BOTTOM_LEFT``：点标记以坐标点为左下角"
msgstr ""
"``BOTTOM_LEFT``: The point marker uses the coordinate point as the lower "
"left corner"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:124
msgid "``BOTTOM_RIGHT``：点标记以坐标点为右下角"
msgstr ""
"``BOTTOM_RIGHT``: The point mark uses the coordinate point as the lower "
"right corner"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:125
msgid "``BOTTOM_CENTER``：点标记以坐标点为下侧中心"
msgstr ""
"``BOTTOM_CENTER``: The point mark uses the coordinate point as the lower "
"center"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:126
msgid "``CENTER OF MASS``：点标记以检测框的质心位置为中心"
msgstr ""
"``CENTER OF MASS``: The point marker is centered on the center of mass "
"position of the detection frame"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:130
msgid "设置点标记的半径大小，单位为像素。默认值为 ``4``。"
msgstr ""
"Set the radius size of the point marker in pixels. The default value is "
"``4``."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:132
msgid "``3``：较小的点"
msgstr "``3``: smaller points"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:133
msgid "``5``：标准大小（默认）"
msgstr "``5``: standard size (default)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:134
msgid "``8`` 及以上：较大的点"
msgstr "``8`` and above: Larger points"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:136
msgid "点半径越大，标记越明显，但可能遮挡更多图像细节。建议根据图像分辨率和标注目标的大小调整此参数。"
msgstr ""
"The larger the point radius, the more obvious the mark will be, but may "
"obscure more image details.It is recommended to adjust this parameter based "
"on the image resolution and the size of the annotation target."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dot_display.rst:140
msgid "设置点外圈的轮廓粗细，单位为像素。默认值为 ``0``。"
msgstr ""
"Set the outline thickness of the outer circle of points, in pixels.The "
"default value is ``0``."
